The energy reference includes the restored SCAN local contribution at finite
density and zero density gradient. On 2026-10-28, independent CG calculations
with the old and corrected XC implementations at 1/2/4 MPI ranks reproduced
the energy shift of approximately +6.16077e-4 eV. The revised reference comes
from corrected CG; fresh runs at all three MPI sizes passed the original
five property checks. INPUT, the two-electronic-step limit, and acceptance
tolerances are unchanged. This remains a short-step functionality test.
